sequenceDiagram
    participant "Presentation: ReadingController" as PresentationReadingController
    participant "Application: GetBookByIsbnQueryHandler" as ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler
    actor "Infrastructure: GoogleBooksApiClient" as InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient
    participant "Infrastructure: Polly Resilience Policy" as InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy
    participant "External: Google Books API" as ExternalGoogleBooksAPI

    activate ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler
    PresentationReadingController->>ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler: 1. Sends GetBookByIsbnQuery via MediatR
    ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler-->>PresentationReadingController: Returns BookDetailsDto or throws exception
    activate InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient
    ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler->>InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient: 2. Invokes GetBookByIsbnAsync(isbn)
    InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient-->>ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler: Returns deserialized BookDetailsDto
    activate InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy
    InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient->>InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy: 3. Executes request via Polly PolicyWrap
    InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy-->>InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient: Returns successful HttpResponseMessage or throws exception after exhausting retries.
    InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy->>ExternalGoogleBooksAPI: 4. GET /books/v1/volumes?q=isbn:{isbn}&key={apiKey} (Attempt 1)
    ExternalGoogleBooksAPI-->>InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy: HTTP 503 Service Unavailable
    InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy->>InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy: 5. Catches HttpRequestException, initiates retry delay (Exponential Backoff + Jitter)
    InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy->>ExternalGoogleBooksAPI: 6. GET /books/v1/volumes?q=isbn:{isbn}&key={apiKey} (Attempt 2)
    ExternalGoogleBooksAPI-->>InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy: HTTP 200 OK with JSON payload
    InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy->>InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient: 7. Returns successful HttpResponseMessage
    InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient->>ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler: 8. Deserializes JSON and returns BookDetailsDto
    ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler->>PresentationReadingController: 9. Returns successful result

    note over InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy: The PollyResiliencePolicy is configured at application startup using IHttpClientFactory and AddPo...
    note over InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy: Retry Policy Config: 3 retry attempts. Exponential backoff starting at 2 seconds. Jitter of +/- 5...
    note over InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy: Circuit Breaker Config: Breaks for 30 seconds after 5 consecutive failures. This policy wraps the...

    deactivate InfrastructurePollyResiliencePolicy
    deactivate InfrastructureGoogleBooksApiClient
    deactivate ApplicationGetBookByIsbnQueryHandler
